WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.682
Local smoothing for waves.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.572
Averaging a wave over time should recover smoothness.

3
00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.997
The best human result lost one twelfth.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.206
Split the wave into packets and bound how they crowd across scales.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.505
Claimed: the loss shrinks to any epsilon.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.750
No Lean proof.
